  "source_note": "<!-- zh -->\n漫画分镜。排版：时间轴式，按照早→中→晚或过去→现在→未来沿页面顺序推进。让该分镜机制决定页面结构、阅读顺序、主次画格和镜头节奏；输出一张完整单页漫画页面，画格共同讲述连续情节，角色外观在各格保持一致。\n\n<!-- en -->\nComic storyboard. Layout: Chronological Timeline Progression, panels sequenced sequentially along time axis (morning to night or past to future). Let this storyboard mechanism determine the page structure, reading flow, panel hierarchy, and pacing; output a complete single-page comic where panels tell a continuous story with consistent characters.\n",
